    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_normal_010_normal_08",
      "hash64": "5D19685F176D463C",
      "text": "那麼，讓我們速速地\\n把工作給解決了吧。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
